        "en": "Clients frequently praise the veterinarians, technicians, and assistants for their warmth, dedication, and gentle attitude toward pets. Reviewers appreciate that the team provides clear answers about spay and neuter recovery, though one client noted an unhelpful front-desk interaction when attempting a walk-in visit."
