      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Pet owners consistently commend the clinic's transparent and accessible pricing for spay, neuter, microchipping, and routine vaccine packages. Multiple reviewers emphasize that the low-cost options allow families to maintain essential veterinary wellness care on a manageable budget without sacrificing quality."
      }
    },
